WEBVTT

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:38.370
So, what do you think?

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.990
This is inkredible!

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:42.020
I've been wanting one of these forever,

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:44.110
so I saved up my allowance 
and finally got one!

00:01:44.110 --> 00:01:44.950
Takeru!

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:45.410
Huh?

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:47.920
Can I try?

00:01:48.100 --> 00:01:52.920
<b>I Ink That's Radio-controlled?!</b>

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.740
Be careful...

00:01:56.740 --> 00:01:57.800
Don't worry!

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.190
Sudden brake!

00:02:01.190 --> 00:02:03.090
And now in reverse!

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:08.280
It's pretty cool that humans 
could invent something like this!

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:17.850
Watch where you're going!

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:18.950
Right back at you!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:19.530
Jeez...

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:20.730
Hey, Takeru.

00:02:20.730 --> 00:02:21.280
Huh?

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:24.620
You're the one who saved up 
his allowance to get that toy.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:26.660
It would suck for you,
 if you let her play with it

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.130
and she broke it.

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:29.830
Like I would!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.250
You almost got into a crash just now.

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:35.410
Yeah, because this house is squidding small.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:36.630
Wait a second.

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:38.790
Why don't we take it outside?

00:02:38.790 --> 00:02:40.240
There's a lot more space outside;

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:41.740
we could make it do tons of squidtastic things!

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:44.680
Sorry, but it's too dangerous 
to take the car outside.

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.940
I'm only going to play with it in the house.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:54.160
I want to try it outside.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:55.950
Coming!

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.710
Hello, Aizawa residence.

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.870
Oh, Yuuta?

00:02:58.870 --> 00:02:59.650
Yeah.

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:00.580
What?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:02.310
You bought Hedgehog Cart 2?

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:04.840
Okay, I'll come over right now.

00:03:04.840 --> 00:03:06.290
See you soon.

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.620
See you later!

00:03:16.450 --> 00:03:23.250
I'm just going... to take it out for a 
squiddle bit... just for a squiddle tiny drive.

00:03:23.250 --> 00:03:25.720
That's right.
 Just for a test!

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.630
This thing could go on forever!

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:31.880
Driving it outside is so much fun!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.910
Hey, Alex, stop!

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:37.020
Alex!

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.190
Stop!

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:45.500
Wait...

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.660
Where did the car go?

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.840
Oh, yeah... I just need to make it move.

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:55.420
Found it!

00:04:06.700 --> 00:04:08.480
Now I've really done it.

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:11.220
What am I going to do now?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.080
Takeru, can you come here for a sec?

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.150
What is it?

00:04:21.150 --> 00:04:22.570
Take this.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:26.290
It's my R/C car's controller...

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:30.260
Now I'm going to be your 
radio-controlled squid!

00:04:30.260 --> 00:04:31.450
Why don't you try moving me around?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.160
Huh?

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:36.140
You want to play R/C Car?

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:37.110
All right!

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.080
Go!

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:41.960
Oh, yeah.
 You don't know.

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:43.840
Let's see... Forward!

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:46.610
Reverse!

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:48.970
Right!

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.060
Left!

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:53.150
Hmm... what should I do?

00:04:53.150 --> 00:04:55.600
This is even lamer than 
I thought it would be...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.810
All right, Squid Girl.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.140
Turn on your lights.

00:04:59.140 --> 00:05:01.100
Why the squid are you giving the commands?

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:04.110
Because a R/C car has to move, 
no matter who's controlling it.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.200
That's true.

00:05:08.360 --> 00:05:09.280
Clean the bathroom.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:11.260
The remote can't give that squidding command!

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:13.720
Since when can toy cars talk back?

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:15.620
I thought they just do 
what you tell them to.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:20.170
I broke Takeru's car.

00:05:20.170 --> 00:05:23.560
I guess this kind of punishment 
is only natural.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:27.040
It was just a joke.

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:31.270
Hey, she said it was a joke, 
so don't worry about it.

00:05:31.270 --> 00:05:32.550
That won't do.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:33.540
What?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:46.820
I see...

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:48.280
Squid Girlie?

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:51.620
Is there anything you want 
me to do for you, Takeru?

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.240
I'll do anything you squidding want.

00:05:53.240 --> 00:05:55.130
What's going on, all of a sudden?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.250
Well I...

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.300
You see, I...

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:07.010
I broke your precious R/C car.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:08.030
What?

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:12.290
I found this in my room.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:18.390
I'm truly squidding sorry.

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.680
You were all worried about that?

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.000
Toys break all the time.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.760
I'm not worried about it.

00:06:27.760 --> 00:06:29.820
You shouldn't worry about it, either.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:30.860
Takeru!

00:06:33.650 --> 00:06:36.810
He's telling me to not worry 
about it, but it's a lie.

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:38.960
Of course it is, stupid.

00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.130
I guess there's only one thing I can do.

00:06:49.170 --> 00:06:51.590
<b>A few days later...</b>

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.830
This is even cooler than before!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:57.120
Thank you so much, Eiko!

00:06:57.120 --> 00:06:58.980
Don't thank me. 
Thank the Three Stooges.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.050
I told them they could rent 
you for a day, in exchange.

00:07:03.610 --> 00:07:05.570
It's a lot faster than my old one!

00:07:05.570 --> 00:07:07.870
It's responding much better, too!

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:08.570
Huh?

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.860
I wonder what this does.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.920
The Three Stooges are 
going to hear about this!

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.390
And...

00:07:39.380 --> 00:07:40.510
It's done!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.760
What are you doing?

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.580
Can't you tell?

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.920
Today's Tanabata, so we're 
preparing for that.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:50.900
We have our guests write their 
wishes on slips of paper.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:52.100
Tanabata?

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:53.120
Slips of paper?

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.850
You don't know about this?

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.650
These are the slips.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.980
They say your wish will come 
true if you write it on here

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:00.870
