00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:03.360
Wow, for squidding real?!

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:05.830
I want to do it too!

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:10.840
Squidn't it Tanabata?!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.450
I'm done!

00:08:14.450 --> 00:08:16.260
I wanna be taller
I wanna eat oceans of shrimp
I wanna subdue mankind

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:16.390
Hey, it's one slip per person!

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:18.200
I wanna be stronger
I wanna be taller
I wanna eat oceans of shrimp
I wanna subdue mankind and 
   conquer the surface world

00:08:16.690 --> 00:08:18.220
You can't cram a whole 
bunch of wishes onto one!

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:21.920
But I can't narrow my wishes 
down to just one!

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:22.940
It doesn't matter!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.620
You can only have one wish.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.520
Just take your time and think it over.

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.930
Lemon

00:08:36.520 --> 00:08:38.140
Looks like everyone's doing it.

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.330
I'm glad they're having fun.

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.770
I want to drink lots of 
juice - Yumi Sakamoto

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:43.770
I want to be a Masked 
