00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.310
What are you trying to say?!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:03.210
Though...

00:09:03.210 --> 00:09:06.330
Tanabata wishes aren't about 
whether they'll come true or not.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.020
It's just fun to think about 
