Where's the bamboo wish grantin' tree?

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:30.040
Yahoo!

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:31.300
And now...

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.000
we are gonna write...

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.740
our wishes!!

