00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.150
Let's start with a...

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:41.050
beer!

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.640
I thought you were working!

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.420
Anyway, you're scientists!

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:48.150
Are you even allowed to do stuff 
