00:09:48.420 --> 00:09:49.510
We keep work...

00:09:49.510 --> 00:09:51.370
and pleasure separate!

00:09:53.710 --> 00:09:57.400
So what do you three stooges want?
 Increased pay or what?

00:09:57.640 --> 00:10:00.380
No, no. Our wish...

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:01.930
is to solve...

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.300
every mystery of space and aliens!

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.750
That's too big!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.810
I guess we'll keep this 
restaurant's capacity

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.580
in mind when we make our wish.

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.230
Man, you make me mad.

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:13.840
It's Tanabata!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:14.650
Kiyomi!

00:10:14.650 --> 00:10:16.880
Is it okay if I write my wish?

00:10:17.150 --> 00:10:19.200
Feel free!

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:20.150
Okay, then...

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:23.640
Wow, it's like you're not 
wavering for even a second!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:28.140
I gotta write my wish quickly too, 
if I don't want to squidding miss out.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:31.730
First, I need the strength 
