00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:18.110
"I hope we can all make it to the 
prefectural tournament together."

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.550
Um... wait... that's...

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.950
So, that's a wish Kiyomi 
