different from yours.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:26.100
That's... um... excuse me...

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:28.120
Please... please... please...

00:11:27.590 --> 00:11:28.120
Huh?

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.360
