The back is as black as the deep sea!

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:47.430
I really like it, Kiyomi!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.460
Thanks, Squiddie.

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:52.200
Have you already 
written your wish, Eiko?

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:52.820
I did!

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.650
I bet you wrote something really shallow,

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.970
