00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:49.230
and they wrote their wishes 
on pieces of paper.

00:12:49.230 --> 00:12:52.070
Supposedly that's the story of Tanabata.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:55.330
I wish you and I loved each other

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:57.660
like Orihime and 
Hikoboshi did, Squiddie!

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.050
I guess that wouldn't be too bad.

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:00.050
Huh?

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:02.150
Then I'd only have to 
see you once a year.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.330
You're terrible!

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:07.700
I just can't decide which wish I want.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:10.010
You really aren't going to 
get this done today.

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.770
Squid Girlie!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:14.560
