I wrote that I want to play more with you,

00:13:20.130 --> 00:13:25.200
I want to play more with the invader Squid Girl!!

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.160
after your invasion is complete.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.200
Takeru!

